        {
          "id": "arrival-story",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "周六下午两点多，拎着一堆零食坐高铁出发。说是旅行，心里其实只装着一件事——凤凰传奇。",
              "en": "We left Shanghai a little after two on Saturday afternoon, carrying an unreasonable amount of snacks onto the high-speed train. Technically it was a trip; emotionally, it was just one thing — Phoenix Legend."
            }
          ]
        },
