          "title": {
            "zh": "🏨 杭州滨江星光大道亚朵酒店",
            "en": "🏨 Atour Hotel, Binjiang Starlight Avenue"
          },
          "body": {
            "zh": "滨江区滨盛路1786号，距江汉路地铁站步行约950米。江景双床房、房间宽敞干净、床很舒服，前台知道我们来看演唱会后还送了凤凰传奇限定手环。唯一扣分项是淋浴水温忽冷忽热。",
            "en": "Address: 1786 Binsheng Road, Binjiang District, about a 950-meter walk from Jianghan Road metro station. We booked a river-view twin room: spacious, clean, comfortable beds. When the front desk heard we were there for the concert, they gave us Phoenix Legend wristbands. The only minus: shower temperature kept drifting hot and cold."
          }
