        {
          "id": "concert-story",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "进场落座，台上「吉祥如意」四个大字铺满整块屏幕，水墨山河的背景连绵铺开，气势磅礴。开场之后完全停不下来——《策马奔腾》的辽阔，《月亮之上》的全场大合唱，还有那幕舞台打出巨幅玫瑰、屏幕飘出歌词的瞬间，台下万人齐声，真的有点上头。",
              "en": "Once we sat down, the four characters “吉祥如意” filled the entire screen, backed by an ink-painting landscape that rolled across the stage. Then the show started and never really let up: the open-sky momentum of “策马奔腾,” the full-stadium singalong to “月亮之上,” and that huge rose blooming across the screens while lyrics floated out above the crowd. Ten thousand people singing at once does something to you."
            }
          ]
        },
