        {
          "id": "concert-tips",
          "type": "note",
          "spacing": { "top": 16 },
          "title": {
            "zh": "💡 演唱会 Tips",
            "en": "💡 Concert notes"
          },
          "body": {
            "zh": "提前告诉酒店前台是来看演唱会的，可能有惊喜。大麦 App 购票，入场记得带身份证；散场后人流量大，提前规划好离场路线，直接去宵夜效率最高。",
            "en": "Tell the hotel front desk you are in town for a concert — sometimes there are small surprises. Tickets were through Damai; bring your ID for entry. After the show, crowds are heavy, so plan your exit route and go straight to supper."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ouji-late-night-food",
      "sectionId": "late-night-food",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "ouji-header",
          "type": "header",
          "markerLabel": { "zh": "Day", "en": "Day" },
          "markerValue": { "zh": "1", "en": "1" },
          "title": {
            "zh": "散场后的江西辣",
            "en": "Jiangxi spice after the show"
          },
          "subtitle": {
            "zh": "欧记大排档 · 景德菜 · 杭州旗舰店",
            "en": "Ouji Food Stall · Jingdezhen cuisine · Hangzhou flagship"
          },
          "icon": "🌶️"
        },
        {
          "id": "ouji-story",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "散场直奔欧记，这顿宵夜是整趟旅行的高潮之一。辣椒炒肉红绿椒密密麻麻，卤凤爪酱汁浓稠，白灼鱿鱼给嘴巴短暂喘息，石锅鸡带着热气上桌，香气直冲脑门。最后两人举起饮料碰了一杯——一粉一绿，算是给这个亢奋的夜晚正式画上句号。",
              "en": "After the concert we went straight to Ouji, and this late-night meal became one of the trip's highlights. Stir-fried pork buried under red and green chilies; braised chicken feet in a deep, sticky sauce; boiled squid as the table's only clean pause; and stone-pot chicken arriving still bubbling. We clinked two drinks — one pink, one green — and called the night complete."
            }
          ]
        },
