        {
          "id": "wuliu-introduction",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "没吃早餐，直接退房出门，用脚步丈量这座城市安静的那一面。转进五柳巷，立刻换了一种频道：白墙黑瓦、石板小道，旁边流着一条窄窄的河，柳枝垂下来，粉色玉兰开得正好。",
              "en": "No breakfast. We checked out and went straight into the quieter side of the city. The moment we turned into Wuliu Lane, the frequency changed: white walls, black tiles, stone paths, a narrow canal running beside us, willow branches dipping down, and pink magnolias in bloom."
            }
          ]
