          "spacing": { "top": 16, "bottom": 12 },
          "icon": "🐱"
        },
        {
          "id": "cat-story",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "最让人停下来的，是街口石墩上坐着的那只三花猫。背对着人，仰头望着一树粉花，纹丝不动，旁边石墩上还剩几粒干粮——大概是哪位街坊留给它的。也不理我们，就自顾自地看它的风景。",
              "en": "The scene that stopped us was a calico cat sitting on a stone post at the lane entrance. Back turned to everyone, head tilted up toward a tree full of pink flowers, not moving at all. A few bits of cat food sat on the next post — probably left by a neighbor. The cat ignored us completely and kept watching its own view."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "wuliu-details-gallery",
          "type": "gallery",
          "layout": "three",
          "spacing": { "top": 8 },
          "images": [
            {
              "imageId": "calico-cat",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "看花的三花猫",
                "en": "The blossom-watching cat"
              },
              "shape": "square",
              "tone": "golden"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "old-window",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "白墙黑瓦，老木窗",
                "en": "White walls and an old wooden window"
              },
              "shape": "square",
              "tone": "warm"
            },
            {
              "imageId": "tofu-banner",
              "caption": {
                "zh": "臭豆腐旗幡",
                "en": "Stinky tofu banner"
              },
              "shape": "square",
              "tone": "cool"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "wuliu-suitable-note",
          "type": "note",
          "spacing": { "top": 16 },
          "title": {
            "zh": "✅ 适合",
            "en": "✅ Best for"
          },
          "body": {
            "zh": "不赶行程、喜欢市井气息、爱拍照出片的人。这里没有刻意的景点感，就是一条还在过日子的老街。",
            "en": "Slow walkers, old-lane people, and anyone who likes a place that still feels lived-in. It does not try too hard to be a tourist attraction, which is exactly why it works."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
