          "id": "deshou-story",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "zh": "从五柳巷步行可达。这里是南宋皇城原址保护展示，脚踩着八百年前的地基，历史感从脚底渗上来。馆内有复原的宋代寝殿和御苑，古朴松树、山水庭院，还原了当年皇城的格局。",
              "en": "Deshou Palace is walkable from Wuliu Lane. It preserves and displays the remains of the Southern Song imperial city; standing over foundations from eight centuries ago, the history feels like it is rising from the floor. Inside are reconstructed Song-style halls and gardens, with pines, courtyards, and water-stone compositions restoring the outline of the old palace."
            }
