          "spacing": { "top": 16 },
          "title": {
            "zh": "🏛️ 参观感受",
            "en": "🏛️ Visit note"
          },
          "body": {
            "zh": "展陈方式很用心，古今叠加的层次感做得很好。对历史感兴趣的话，建议预留1.5-2小时慢慢看。",
            "en": "The exhibition design is thoughtful, especially the way old foundations and new reconstruction are layered. If you like history, give it 1.5-2 hours."
          }
